# 一律以 LF 存库并以 LF 检出，不随各人的 core.autocrlf 变化。
# 构建工具写出的是 LF，Windows 上若按 CRLF 检出，生成产物每次构建后都会永久显示为
# 已修改而 diff 为空；「重跑生成器后 git diff --exit-code」这类门禁也会只在 Windows 上误报。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 源码与配置一律按文本处理，不走二进制自动探测
*.ts text eol=lf
*.tsx text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.cjs text eol=lf
*.vue text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.svg text eol=lf
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary

# 锁文件不参与 diff 展示，冲突一律重装解决
pnpm-lock.yaml -diff linguist-generated=true
